        },
        {
          "text": "Amba kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Ncobeni ndi sinkondonyoko, O Farao mwami wa-Egepita, webo ontale oolede akati katulonga twako, ooamba kuti, Mulonga wangu nguwangu, ndime ndakaulenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
