                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoocita kuti nyika ya­-Egepita ibe cisi citakalwi akati kazisinyina zitakalwi, aminzi yayo ibule bantu akati kaminzinyina iitakalwi, myaka iili makumi one. Njoopalanganya ba-Egepita akati kabamasi akubamwaisya munyika zyoonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
